#: templates/landing.html:661
msgid ""
"Keydion is an academic asset platform designed for high school research. "
"We focus on student\n"
"            scholarship — IA, EE, TOK, and independent projects — "
"ensuring that excellent work is systematically\n"
"            preserved, searchable, and citable."
msgstr ""
"Keydion 是一个专为高中设计的学术资产平台。我们聚焦于学生的科研成果，包括 IA、EE、TOK "
"等项目。通过本平台，学生的研究成果将不再被忽视，而是被系统性地保存于 Keydion "
"数据库中，供师生查阅与参考。同时，教师也可以更全面地了解本校科研项目的内容与整体质量。"

