#: templates/landing.html:680
msgid "Our Mission"
msgstr "学术使命"

#: templates/landing.html:681
msgid ""
"By building a living archive of student research, we help schools "
"maintain academic integrity,\n"
"            prevent topic collisions, and let each cohort build on the "
"discoveries of the last."
